# Mesh > View's "Show mesh" switch: off, the view says so and nothing is drawn, and the Overview drops its cross
# section; the setting is saved, and switching it back on reads the mesh again.
open $SB/ws/pitzDaily
click nav:mesh
wait-until page Mesh
click text:View
wait 20
assert text cells
click label:Show mesh
wait 5
assert text The mesh view is off
screenshot $OUT/mesh-off.png
click nav:overview
wait 10
screenshot $OUT/overview-off.png
click nav:mesh
wait 5
click label:Show mesh
wait 20
assert text cells
screenshot $OUT/mesh-on.png
quit
